        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Week 3 周龄计划表</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#ffffff;\n    font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n    color:#1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page{\n    width:540px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    padding:28px 18px 40px 18px;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    position:relative;\n  }\n  .watermark{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:60px;\n    top:330px;\n    font-size:76px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    color:#f2f2f2;\n    letter-spacing:6px;\n    z-index:0;\n    line-height:0.95;\n    user-select:none;\n  }\n  table.main{\n    width:100%;\n    border-collapse:collapse;\n    position:relative;\n    z-index:1;\n    background:transparent;\n  }\n  table.main td{\n    border:1px solid #f5c86a;\n    vertical-align:middle;\n  }\n  .lbl{\n    background:#fdf0c9;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:17px;\n    width:88px;\n    padding:10px 4px;\n  }\n  .hdr{\n    text-align:center;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:22px;\n    padding:12px 4px;\n  }\n  .goal{\n    text-align:center;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:15px;\n    padding:9px 4px;\n  }\n  .subtable{\n    width:100%;\n    border-collapse:collapse;\n  }\n  .subtable td{\n    border:none;\n    vertical-align:middle;\n  }\n  .subtable tr:not(:last-child) td{\n    border-bottom:1px dashed #f0b93c;\n  }\n  .sub-lbl{\n    width:96px;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:14px;\n    padding:12px 4px;\n    border-right:1px dashed #f0b93c !important;\n  }\n  .sub-body{\n    font-size:13.5px;\n    line-height:1.75;\n    padding:10px 10px 10px 12px;\n    text-align:left;\n  }\n  .notes{\n    font-size:13.5px;\n    line-height:1.9;\n    padding:12px 14px 14px 12px;\n    text-align:left;\n  }\n  .notes p{margin:0 0 2px 0;}\n  .indent1{padding-left:0;}\n  .indent2{padding-left:14px;}\n  .indent3{padding-left:22px;}\n  .u{text-decoration:underline;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"watermark\">MOM<br>POWER</div>\n\n  <table class=\"main\">\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"lbl\">周龄</td>\n      <td class=\"hdr\">Week 3</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"lbl\">新目标</td>\n      <td class=\"goal\">帮宝宝分辨昼夜</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"lbl\">怎么做</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:0;\">\n        <table class=\"subtable\">\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"sub-lbl\">在白天：</td>\n            <td class=\"sub-body\">\n              ① 当宝宝醒着的时候，开灯、开窗，保持光线明亮<br>\n              ② 宝宝吃奶后，保持TA清醒一会儿，做一些亲子活动比如唱歌说话、俯卧训练<br>\n              ③ 喂食间隔不要超过3个小时。如果有必要，叫醒他<br>\n              ④ 白天一次清醒时长30–60分钟，包括喂奶时间在内\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"sub-lbl\">在晚上：</td>\n            <td class=\"sub-body\">\n              ① 继续停喂，如果在停喂之后，确定宝宝需要喂奶或换尿布，不要和TA玩，也不要和TA说太多话<br>\n              ② 晚上喂奶前换好尿布，可以用吸水量大一些的夜用尿不湿<br>\n              ③ 尽可能把宝宝裹起来（襁褓及睡袋介绍见之前笔记）\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"sub-lbl\">昼夜模式区分<br>清晰</td>\n            <td class=\"sub-body\">\n              总之，充分区分白天和黑夜的环境和活动模式的不同，尽可能把长时间的睡眠留到晚上。\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"lbl\">注意事项</td>\n      <td class=\"notes\">\n        <p class=\"indent1\">1.在这个周龄，不要太担心养成不好的睡觉习惯。宝宝在你怀里或身上小睡一会儿是完全没问题的。不用强调作息时间，跟着宝宝的自然节奏就行了。</p>\n        <p class=\"indent2\">3.夜晚不走觉、玩、睡的周期，除了换尿布和喂奶之外，不需要清醒时间</p>\n        <p class=\"indent3\">4.只要宝宝健康，体重正常增长，不需要<span class=\"u\">在晚上</span>叫醒宝宝喂奶。尽可能让他自己醒来</p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
